# Typing and long input that wraps past the editor width
# (internal/tui/editor: textarea wraps at the input box width; nothing is
# submitted here, so no faux turn is consumed).
@faux testdata/faux/hello.yaml
@size 120x40

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
SHOT input-empty
TYPE short line
SHOT input-short
EXPECT /short line/
KEY ctrl+u
TYPE this is a deliberately long single line of input typed with no line breaks at all so that it must wrap onto a second visual row inside the input box at 120 columns wide
SHOT input-wrapped
EXPECT /deliberately long single line/
# the line wraps inside the box: the second row continues it
EXPECT /must wrap onto a second\s*\n\s+visual row inside the input box/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
